dialogue prologue_rematch
title: The Rematch
trigger: Prologue Rematch
backdrop: greenvalley
speaker commander $commander
speaker redmage redmage
speaker barbarian barbarian
speaker knight knight

node shattered commander
  The Collector's plate lies in pieces on the bridge. His keys hang at his belt.
  -> mage

node mage redmage
  You took his plate off with an axe. I like you already.
  -> axe

node axe barbarian
  Took all night to learn. Worth it.
  -> wagon

node wagon knight
  His chest is on the white wagon. Gold, a flask, a book. And the wagon is ours now too.
  -> join

node join redmage
  He kept that book from me for a month. Let me read it, and I'll show you what it's for.
